  "verification_confidence": "medium",
  "base_medium": "Artificial seawater (ASW) medium of Wilson, Carr & Mann 1996 (J. Phycol. 32:506-516), modified: NaNO3 replaced by 8.8 mM NH4Cl, 10 mM sodium succinate added as carbon source, MAMS vitamins (Chen 2012) added at 1 ml/L, and P reduced/varied (50 uM-1.73 mM) supplied as K2HPO4, phosphocholine or phosphorylethanolamine.",
