     "obtained": true,
     "how": "WebFetch/Read of the Chisholm-lab (MIT) Prochlorococcus & Synechococcus culturing manual media-comparison table, whose ASW column is explicitly footnoted 'Wilson et al. (1996) J. Phycol 32, 506-516'",
     "added": [
      "NaCl 25 g/L",
      "MgCl2 2 g/L",
      "MgSO4 3.5 g/L",
      "KCl 0.5 g/L",
      "CaCl2 0.5 g/L",
      "Tris buffer 9.08 mM",
      "EDTA 1.3 uM",
      "FeCl3 11.1 uM",
