      "CuSO4 0.03 uM",
      "Co(NO3)2 0.17 uM"
     ]
    },
    {
     "what": "MAMS vitamins solution cited as ref 62 (Chen 2012, Environ. Microbiol. 14:2308-2322)",
     "obtained": true,
     "how": "WebFetch of marine-Roseobacter methods (PMC8319176 and DSMZ medium 1313 / PMC4331573) that reproduce the Chen-2012 MAMS medium and its 1 ml/L vitamin solution",
     "added": [
      "thiamine 30 nM",
      "nicotinic acid 160 nM",
      "pyridoxine 97 nM",
      "4-aminobenzoate 73 nM",
